  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, c’est toi ?! Tu tombes bien, on est justement\nen train de tourner un autre film de ma trilogie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette fois-ci, on est sur une ambiance\nde film d’horreur !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500740074006500200066006F00690073002D00630069002C0020006F006E0020006500730074002000730075007200200075006E006500200061006D006200690061006E00630065000A00640065002000660069006C006D0020006420190068006F007200720065007500720020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et la star de ce film est celui qu’on appelle\nle fantôme sylvestre : Desséliande !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a juste un hic... Les Pokémon sauvages,\nde type Spectre qui plus est... ça fait super peur !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pourquoi j’aurais encore besoin\nde tes services.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006F0075007200710075006F00690020006A201900610075007200610069007300200065006E0063006F007200650020006200650073006F0069006E000A006400650020007400650073002000730065007200760069006300650073002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Desséliande sauvages sont assez rares,\nmais il est possible d’en trouver.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On en aurait aperçu dans la zone sauvage nº 13\nou nº 15... T’en croiseras peut-être un là-bas !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sinon, tu peux aussi faire évoluer un Brocélôme...\nPeu importe, tant que j’ai un Desséliande à filmer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, quand t’en auras un, amène-le-moi,\ns’il te plaît ! Au fait, ce film, on le tourne de nuit !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux nous donner un coup de main\nsur ce tournage ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAjoute un Desséliande à ton équipe\net amène-le ici de nuit !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, tu nous as amené un Desséliande !\nMais on tourne la nuit, donc reviens plus tard !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le tournage est encore en pause ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200074006F00750072006E006100670065002000650073007400200065006E0063006F0072006500200065006E0020007000610075007300650020003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On va tourner une scène d’horreur...\nJ’ai déjà des frissons...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200076006100200074006F00750072006E0065007200200075006E006500200073006300E8006E00650020006420190068006F00720072006500750072002E002E002E000A004A2019006100690020006400E9006A00E00020006400650073002000660072006900730073006F006E0073002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien que je filme ton Desséliande ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E00200071007500650020006A0065002000660069006C006D006500200074006F006E0020004400650073007300E9006C00690061006E006400650020003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hors de question.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F007200730020006400650020007100750065007300740069006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais... sans Pokémon, la scène perdra\ntoute son intensité !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100690073002E002E002E002000730061006E007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C0020006C006100200073006300E8006E00650020007000650072006400720061000A0074006F00750074006500200073006F006E00200069006E00740065006E00730069007400E90020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, t’es l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଊe meilleura meilleure !\nAllez, ça tourne !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002C002000742019006500730020006C00100003110000FF0B0A00650020006D00650069006C006C00650075007200610020006D00650069006C006C006500750072006500200021000A0041006C006C0065007A002C002000E7006100200074006F00750072006E00650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout est en place ?\nOK... Action !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00750074002000650073007400200065006E00200070006C0061006300650020003F000A004F004B002E002E002E00200041006300740069006F006E0020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette forêt...\nSerait-elle... hantée ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500740074006500200066006F007200EA0074002E002E002E000A005300650072006100690074002D0065006C006C0065002E002E002E002000680061006E007400E900650020003F002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais non, voyons !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006E006F006E002C00200076006F0079006F006E00730020002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends... tu n’as pas entendu un bruit ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640073002E002E002E0020007400750020006E201900610073002000700061007300200065006E00740065006E0064007500200075006E0020006200720075006900740020003F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002C0020006E006F006E0020003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dédééé !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E9006400E900E900E9002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AAAAAAAAAAAAH !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410041004100410041004100410041004100410041004100480020002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... ou pas ?\nIl ne fait pas peur du tout !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020006F007500200070006100730020003F000A0049006C0020006E00650020006600610069007400200070006100730020007000650075007200200064007500200074006F007500740020002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Coupez !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F007500700065007A002000210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non mais allô ? C’est le fantôme sylvestre\nou la fée des champs fleuris, là ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, ce serait pas parce que les Desséliande sont\nsuper sympas avec les habitants de la forêt ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il nous a pris pour des créatures des bois ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006E006F00750073002000610020007000720069007300200070006F00750072002000640065007300200063007200E9006100740075007200650073002000640065007300200062006F006900730020003F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ?! Un Pokémon Spectre gentil uniquement\nenvers ses camarades sylvestres ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyable ! On a immortalisé un moment\nPokémon brut et authentique !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006F007900610062006C0065002000210020004F006E0020006100200069006D006D006F007200740061006C0069007300E900200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062007200750074002000650074002000610075007400680065006E007400690071007500650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a beau dire, les images ne trompent jamais !\nTant que je peux dépeindre la réalité qui nous<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nentoure, ça me dérange pas de réécrire le script !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Serais-je le premier à avoir immortalisé\nla véritable nature de Desséliande ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... c’est vraiment acceptable de changer le\nscript juste pour que ça colle mieux aux images ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Desséliande a un regard si doux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650073007300E9006C00690061006E006400650020006100200075006E002000720065006700610072006400200073006900200064006F007500780020002100100002011401960000",
